  "tests": [
   {
    "id": "step3",
    "description": "cam_rad_out_ifc.csv rows (step 3, day, clear, esd-reversed), cam_rad_input.csv pint_hi (ze = -pint_hi reversed) and cam_rad_out.csv / cam_rad_scal.csv: the RRTMG heating as the layer flux divergence on the esd column - qrs = -g*(fns(k+1)-fns(k))/dp reads qrs = g*D(fns) and qrl = +g*(fnl(k+1)-fnl(k))/dp reads qrl = -g*D(fnl) on the ze coordinate (radsw.F90:573-574, radlw.F90:244-245, verified to 3e-16 W/kg by the stage-1 validator) - fns = fds - fus and fnl = ful - fdl (radsw.F90:565-567, radlw.F90:237-238), the history scalars as index picks (fsnt = fns[NLEV+1] etc., radsw.F90:552-562, radlw.F90:214-228) and the column integrals sum(qrs dp/g) = fsnt - fsns, sum(qrl dp/g) = flns - flnt. fsns is skipped (fns[1] = 0 exactly on the albedo-1 step).",
